# AWS Serverless API

## Module 05: AWS Lambda & Serverless

### Project Overview
This project demonstrates serverless
computing using AWS Lambda and API Gateway.

### Technologies
- AWS Lambda
- Amazon API Gateway
- Node.js
- JavaScript
- JSON

### Features
- Serverless API
- HTTP GET request
- JSON response
- Lambda function integration

